  "title": "Soda Cracker Candy",
  "description": "Try this cracker candy recipe for decadent candy that tastes like chocolate-covered toffee. Share some as a holiday gift or keep it all to yourself!",
  "authors": [
    "Rebecca Lott"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-10-15T00:29:27-04:00",
